=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,3,4)\">Lev 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 3:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,3,10)\">Lev 3:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 3:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,3,15)\">Lev 3:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 4:9\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(3,4,9)\">Lev 4:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 7:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,4)\">Lev 7:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 8:16\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,16)\">Lev 8:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 8:25\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(3,8,25)\">Lev 8:25</ref> (all <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); in figure of sacrifice Edomites <bdbheb>חֵלֶב כִּלְיוֺת אֵילִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 34:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,34,6)\">Isa 34:6</ref> transferred to wheat,<bdbheb>חֵלֶב כִּלְיוֺת חִטָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,14)\">Deut 32:14</ref> <highlight>kidney-fat</highlight> (i.e. the choicest, richest) <highlight>of wheat</highlight>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> figurative, as seat of emotion and affection <ref ref=\"Job 19:27\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(18,19,27)\">Job 19:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Prov 23:16\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(20,23,16)\">Prov 23:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 16:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,16,7)\">Ps 16:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 73:21\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"73\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"73\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(19,73,21)\">Ps 73:21</ref> <bdbheb>קָרוֺב אַתָּה בְּפִיהֶם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וְרָחוֺק מִכּ</b